From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Install the complete default generated HTML documentation

The original three extension globs omit JavaScript, SVG, font and nested
assets produced by current Doxygen, including their embedded notices.
An unmatched PNG glob can also fail installation. Copy the full generated
tree to the same destination. Do not change configure, all or check.
This is a generic packaging fix, not a RISC-V architecture change.

--- a/docs/doxygen/Makefile.am
+++ b/docs/doxygen/Makefile.am
@@ -9,3 +9,1 @@
-	$(INSTALL_DATA) html/*.html $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
-	$(INSTALL_DATA) html/*.png $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
-	$(INSTALL_DATA) html/*.css $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
+	cp -pR html/. $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
--- a/docs/doxygen/Makefile.in
+++ b/docs/doxygen/Makefile.in
@@ -488,3 +488,1 @@
-@WITH_LIBABW_DOCS_TRUE@	$(INSTALL_DATA) html/*.html $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
-@WITH_LIBABW_DOCS_TRUE@	$(INSTALL_DATA) html/*.png $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
-@WITH_LIBABW_DOCS_TRUE@	$(INSTALL_DATA) html/*.css $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
+@WITH_LIBABW_DOCS_TRUE@	cp -pR html/. $(DESTDIR)$(docdir)/html/
